+name: stopi
+long_name: Supervisor Top Interrupt Pending
+address: 0x15B
+priv_mode: S
+length: MXLEN
+writable: false
+description: |
+  A read of stopi returns zero either if no interrupt is both pending and
+  enabled, or if no pending-and-enabled interrupt has an identity number less
